Description:It is your upkeep. You control Possessed Portal and Underrealm Lich and no lands; your hand is one Colossal Dreadmaw. The top three cards of your library are Island, Island and Lightning Bolt. End the turn at 20 life with Lightning Bolt in hand and both Possessed Portal and Underrealm Lich on the battlefield.
